RES osdtriplet
! Batch 2: set-then-query with SUR SA / FIR checkpoints
INS S3
SUR SA
CUY S2 0.05
SUR SA
GLA S2 N-BK7
SUR SA
ASP S2
K S2 -1.0
SUR SA
SPH S2
SLB S2 FRONT
STO S3
FIR
STOP S4
FIR
REF 1
DIM M
WTW 1 1 1
FIR
SCA EFL 50
FIR
XAN 0 0 0
FIR
YOB 0 3 5
FIR
XOB 0 0 0
FIR
YIM 0 5 10
FIR
SI 0 5.0
SUR SA
KC S2 0
SUR SA
KC S2 100
SUR SA
FLY S1..5
SUR SA
FLIP 1 5
SUR SA
! GCONVERT is destructive (converts glass to model glass) - keep last
GCONVERT 2
SUR SA

! ---- DEL Sk / DEL Si..j: delete surfaces (CODE V) ----
! A range is deleted highest-first, so Si..j names the surfaces as listed
! before the command.  The object and image surfaces cannot be deleted;
! a malformed surface or unknown DEL option is reported (was silent).
RES osdtriplet
DEL S2
SUR SA
DEL S4..5
SUR SA
DEL S0
DEL S5
DEL S2..9
DEL SX
DEL FOO

! ---- Surface insert/delete keeps surface references attached ----
! Optimizer variables, zoom operands and merit-entry surface qualifiers
! follow their surfaces on DEL/INS (and anything on a deleted surface goes
! with it); pickup sources are renumbered on insertion (S6's RDY keeps
! picking up the 50.26 surface) and a pickup whose source is deleted is
! dropped with its value frozen.
RES osdtriplet
CCY S5 0
THC S4 0
ZOO 2
ZOO THI S4 5 6
TAR
UCY S5 = 0.1
HMY S6 = 1
GO
PIK RDY S6 S5 -1 0
DEL S2
SUR SA
ZOO
LCON
INS S3
SUR SA
ZOO
LCON
DEL S5
SUR SA
ZOO
LCON

! ---- Lens editor actions are user-level commands ----
! The editor sends what a user would type: INS Sn / DEL Sn for rows,
! PIK <param> Sk <param> Sj A B for pickups (10-decimal A, B), the CODE V
! solve form (THI Sk HMY v, CUY Sk UCY v), DEL SOL THI|CUY Sk and
! DEL PIK <param> Sk to remove them.  DEL PIK (CODE V) also takes no
! parameter (all pickups) and a surface range.  A marginal-height solve with
! a nonzero target used to be saved as PIM (target lost on reload).
RES osdtriplet
INS S3
SUR SA
DEL S3
PIK RDY S6 RDY S5 -1.0000000000 0.0000000000
PIK GLA S5 S1
CUY S4 UCY 0.10000000
THI S2 HMY 4.00000000
SUR SA
SAV editorcmds
RES editorcmds
SUR SA
DEL PIK RDY S6
DEL SOL CUY S4
DEL SOL THI S2
DEL PIK S1..6
DEL PIK
DEL PIK FOO
DEL PIK Z1
SUR SA
! ---- CODE V surface/system commands, batch 2 ----
! TIN / CIY increments
RES osdtriplet
TIN S2 0.5
CIY S1 0.001
SUR SA
! An A term traces without K (it was ignored until a K or a save/restore)
RES osdtriplet
RSI f2 w1 0 0.7
A S3 1e-5
RSI f2 w1 0 0.7
! BRE: a zero air gap between identical shapes leaves the trace unchanged
K S3 -0.5
RSI f2 w1 0 0.7
BRE S3
RSI f2 w1 0 0.7
SUR SA
! AFC is saved
RES osdtriplet
AFC YES
SAV afcsave
RES afcsave
AFC
AFC NO
! PKL lists pickups (full precision)
PIK RDY S5 RDY S3 -0.333333333333 0.1
PIK THI S4 THI S2 2 0
PKL
PKL S5
! ZLI / DEZ
ZOO 2
ZOO THI S4 5 7
ZLI
DEZ 2
ZLI
SUR S4
! GSC: global positions and orientations
RES osdtriplet
ADE S3 2
YDE S3 0.5
GSC
GSC S3
! Errors
TIN
BRE S0
DEZ 5
AFC MAYBE
